# Public repository boundary: keep executable Python source/tests/scripts,
# the root README, and the small package/repository metadata needed to install
# and validate the source. Manuscripts, results, data, figures, and temporary
# research material stay outside the public checkout.
*
!*/
!*.py
!/README.md
!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/ci.yml

